<http://example.org/dectective/edition/run/leakage-C4> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#nWorlds> "14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/runs> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/run/leakage-C4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#DecRun> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/runs> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "187"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“My dear fellow,” said Sherlock Holmes as we sat on either side of the fire in his lodgings at Baker Street, “life is infinitely stranger than anything which the mind of man could invent." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "277"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "188"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "We would not dare to conceive the things which are really mere commonplaces of existence." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "700"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "278"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "If we could fly out of that window hand in hand, hover over this great city, gently remove the roofs, and peep in at the queer things which are going on, the strange coincidences, the plannings, the cross-purposes, the wonderful chains of events, working through generations, and leading to the most outré results, it would make all fiction with its conventionalities and foreseen conclusions most stale and unprofitable.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/I> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C1" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/holmes> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "749"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "702"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“And yet I am not convinced of it,” I answered." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "842"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "750"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“The cases which come to light in the papers are, as a rule, bald enough, and vulgar enough." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "990"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "843"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "We have in our police reports realism pushed to its extreme limits, and yet the result is, it must be confessed, neither fascinating nor artistic.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/I> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C1" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/watson> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P002> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P003.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "1091"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P003.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P003> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P003.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "992"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P003.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“A certain selection and discretion must be used in producing a realistic effect,” remarked Holmes." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P003.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P003.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "1295"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P003.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P003> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P003.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "1092"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P003.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“This is wanting in the police report, where more stress is laid, perhaps, upon the platitudes of the magistrate than upon the details, which to an observer contain the vital essence of the whole matter." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P003.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P003.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "1362"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P003.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P003> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P003.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "1296"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P003.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Depend upon it, there is nothing so unnatural as the commonplace.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P003.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
