<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "I smiled and shook my head." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
