<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "1392"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“I can quite understand your thinking so.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
