<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "1443"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Of course, in your position of unofficial adviser and helper to everybody who is absolutely puzzled, throughout three continents, you are brought in contact with all that is strange and bizarre." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "1730"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "1639"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "But here”—I picked up the morning paper from the ground—“let us put it to a practical test." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S05> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
