<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "1731"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Here is the first heading upon which I come." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S06> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
