<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S07> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S07> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "1776"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S07> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "‘A husband’s cruelty to his wife.’" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S07> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S08> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "1914"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
