<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S08> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "There is half a column of print, but I know without reading it that it is all perfectly familiar to me." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S08> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S09> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "2031"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S09> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S09> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "1915"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S09> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "There is, of course, the other woman, the drink, the push, the blow, the bruise, the sympathetic sister or landlady." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S09> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S10> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "2088"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S10> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S10> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "2032"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S10> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "The crudest of writers could invent nothing more crude.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P004.S10> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
