<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P005.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "2213"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P005.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P005> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P005.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "2090"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P005.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Indeed, your example is an unfortunate one for your argument,” said Holmes, taking the paper and glancing his eye down it." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P005.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
