<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P005.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "2214"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P005.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“This is the Dundas separation case, and, as it happens, I was engaged in clearing up some small points in connection with it." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P005.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
