<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P006.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "2834"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P006.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P006> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
