<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P009.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“It was from the reigning family of Holland, though the matter in which I served them was of such delicacy that I cannot confide it even to you, who have been good enough to chronicle one or two of my little problems.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
