<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "3574"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "They are important, you understand, without being interesting." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "3832"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "3637"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Indeed, I have found that it is usually in unimportant matters that there is a field for the observation, and for the quick analysis of cause and effect which gives the charm to an investigation." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "3946"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "3833"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "The larger crimes are apt to be the simpler, for the bigger the crime the more obvious, as a rule, is the motive." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "4104"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "3947"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "In these cases, save for one rather intricate matter which has been referred to me from Marseilles, there is nothing which presents any features of interest." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S05> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "4252"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "4105"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "It is possible, however, that I may have something better before very many minutes are over, for this is one of my clients, or I am much mistaken.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P011.S06> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
