<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "4254"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "He had risen from his chair and was standing between the parted blinds gazing down into the dull neutral-tinted London street." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "4638"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "4381"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Looking over his shoulder, I saw that on the pavement opposite there stood a large woman with a heavy fur boa round her neck, and a large curling red feather in a broad-brimmed hat which was tilted in a coquettish Duchess of Devonshire fashion over her ear." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "4828"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "4639"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "From under this great panoply she peeped up in a nervous, hesitating fashion at our windows, while her body oscillated backward and forward, and her fingers fidgeted with her glove buttons." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "4963"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "4829"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Suddenly, with a plunge, as of the swimmer who leaves the bank, she hurried across the road, and we heard the sharp clang of the bell." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
