<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#narrator> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P012> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "5052"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
