<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "4965"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“I have seen those symptoms before,” said Holmes, throwing his cigarette into the fire." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "5117"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "5053"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Oscillation upon the pavement always means an affaire de coeur." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "5211"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "5118"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "She would like advice, but is not sure that the matter is not too delicate for communication." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "5250"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "5212"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "And yet even here we may discriminate." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "5370"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "5251"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "When a woman has been seriously wronged by a man she no longer oscillates, and the usual symptom is a broken bell wire." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S05> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "5486"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "5371"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Here we may take it that there is a love matter, but that the maiden is not so much angry as perplexed, or grieved." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S06> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S07> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "5539"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S07> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S07> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "5487"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S07> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "But here she comes in person to resolve our doubts.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P013.S07> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
