<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P015.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "6099"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P015.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P015> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P015.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "5994"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P015.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Do you not find,” he said, “that with your short sight it is a little trying to do so much typewriting?”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P015.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P015> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/II> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
