<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P016.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "6188"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P016.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P016> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P016.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "6101"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P016.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“I did at first,” she answered, “but now I know where the letters are without looking.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P016.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P016.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "6347"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P016.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P016> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P016.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "6189"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P016.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Then, suddenly realising the full purport of his words, she gave a violent start and looked up, with fear and astonishment upon her broad, good-humoured face." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P016.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P016.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "6431"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P016.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P016> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P016.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "6348"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P016.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“You’ve heard about me, Mr. Holmes,” she cried, “else how could you know all that?”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P016.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
