<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P016> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "6504"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "6433"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Never mind,” said Holmes, laughing; “it is my business to know things." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "6563"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "6505"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Perhaps I have trained myself to see what others overlook." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "6607"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "6564"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "If not, why should you come to consult me?”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
