<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C1" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/holmes> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P017> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "6760"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "6609"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“I came to you, sir, because I heard of you from Mrs. Etherege, whose husband you found so easy when the police and everyone had given him up for dead." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "6812"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "6761"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Oh, Mr. Holmes, I wish you would do as much for me." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "6994"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "6813"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "I’m not rich, but still I have a hundred a year in my own right, besides the little that I make by the machine, and I would give it all to know what has become of Mr. Hosmer Angel.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/II> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "18"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
