<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P018> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P019.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "7132"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P019.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P019> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P019.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "6996"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P019.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Why did you come away to consult me in such a hurry?” asked Sherlock Holmes, with his finger-tips together and his eyes to the ceiling." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P019.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
