<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P019> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C1" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P019> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/holmes> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P019> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P020.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "7216"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P020.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P020> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P020.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "7134"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P020.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Again a startled look came over the somewhat vacuous face of Miss Mary Sutherland." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P020.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P020.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "7359"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P020.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P020> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P020.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "7217"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P020.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Yes, I did bang out of the house,” she said, “for it made me angry to see the easy way in which Mr. Windibank—that is, my father—took it all." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P020.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P020.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "7579"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P020.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P020> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P020.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "7360"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P020.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "He would not go to the police, and he would not go to you, and so at last, as he would do nothing and kept on saying that there was no harm done, it made me mad, and I just on with my things and came right away to you.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P020.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
