<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P020> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "20"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P020> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
