<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P021.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P021> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P021.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "7581"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P021.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Your father,” said Holmes, “your stepfather, surely, since the name is different.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P021.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
