<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P021> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P022.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "7686"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P022.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P022> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P022.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "7666"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P022.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Yes, my stepfather." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P022.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P022.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "7795"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P022.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P022> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P022.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "7687"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P022.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "I call him father, though it sounds funny, too, for he is only five years and two months older than myself.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P022.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P022> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/II> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P022> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "22"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P022> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
