<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P022> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P023.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "7824"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P023.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P023> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P023.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "7797"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P023.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“And your mother is alive?”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P023.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P023> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/II> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P023> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P023> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P023> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C1" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P023> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/holmes> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P023> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "7861"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "7826"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Oh, yes, mother is alive and well." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "8010"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "7862"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "I wasn’t best pleased, Mr. Holmes, when she married again so soon after father’s death, and a man who was nearly fifteen years younger than herself." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "8266"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "8011"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Father was a plumber in the Tottenham Court Road, and he left a tidy business behind him, which mother carried on with Mr. Hardy, the foreman; but when Mr. Windibank came he made her sell the business, for he was very superior, being a traveller in wines." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "8386"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "8267"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "They got £4700 for the goodwill and interest, which wasn’t near as much as father could have got if he had been alive.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/II> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "24"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C1" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/mary> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P024> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P025.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "8570"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P025.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P025> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P025.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "8388"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P025.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "I had expected to see Sherlock Holmes impatient under this rambling and inconsequential narrative, but, on the contrary, he had listened with the greatest concentration of attention." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P025.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
