<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P025> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "25"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P025> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P025> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C1" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P025> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#narrator> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P025> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P026.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "8643"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P026.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P026> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P026.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "8572"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P026.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Your own little income,” he asked, “does it come out of the business?”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P026.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P026> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/II> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P026> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "26"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P026> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P026> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C1" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P026> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/holmes> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P026> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "8658"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "8645"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Oh, no, sir." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "8724"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "8659"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "It is quite separate and was left me by my uncle Ned in Auckland." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "8772"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "8725"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "It is in New Zealand stock, paying 4½ per cent." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "8857"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "8773"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Two thousand five hundred pounds was the amount, but I can only touch the interest.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/II> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "27"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C1" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/mary> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P027> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "8900"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "8859"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“You interest me extremely,” said Holmes." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "9057"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "8901"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“And since you draw so large a sum as a hundred a year, with what you earn into the bargain, you no doubt travel a little and indulge yourself in every way." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "9139"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "9058"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "I believe that a single lady can get on very nicely upon an income of about £60.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/II> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "28"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C1" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/holmes> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P028> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "9350"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "9141"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“I could do with much less than that, Mr. Holmes, but you understand that as long as I live at home I don’t wish to be a burden to them, and so they have the use of the money just while I am staying with them." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "9393"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "9351"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Of course, that is only just for the time." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "9537"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "9394"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Mr. Windibank draws my interest every quarter and pays it over to mother, and I find that I can do pretty well with what I earn at typewriting." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "9628"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "9538"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "It brings me twopence a sheet, and I can often do from fifteen to twenty sheets in a day.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/II> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "29"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C1" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/mary> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P029> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "9690"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "9630"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“You have made your position very clear to me,” said Holmes." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "9776"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "9691"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“This is my friend, Dr. Watson, before whom you can speak as freely as before myself." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "9845"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "9777"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Kindly tell us now all about your connection with Mr. Hosmer Angel.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/II> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C1" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/holmes> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P030> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "9943"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "9847"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "A flush stole over Miss Sutherland’s face, and she picked nervously at the fringe of her jacket." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "9996"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "9944"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“I met him first at the gasfitters’ ball,” she said." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "10114"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "9997"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“They used to send father tickets when he was alive, and then afterwards they remembered us, and sent them to mother." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "10151"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "10115"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Mr. Windibank did not wish us to go." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "10188"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "10152"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "He never did wish us to go anywhere." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S05> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "10265"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "10189"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "He would get quite mad if I wanted so much as to join a Sunday-school treat." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S06> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S07> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "10349"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S07> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S07> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "10266"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S07> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "But this time I was set on going, and I would go; for what right had he to prevent?" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S07> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S08> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "10439"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S08> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S08> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "10350"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S08> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "He said the folk were not fit for us to know, when all father’s friends were to be there." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S08> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S09> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "10563"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S09> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S09> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "10440"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S09> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "And he said that I had nothing fit to wear, when I had my purple plush that I had never so much as taken out of the drawer." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S09> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S10> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "10766"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S10> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S10> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "10564"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S10> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "At last, when nothing else would do, he went off to France upon the business of the firm, but we went, mother and I, with Mr. Hardy, who used to be our foreman, and it was there I met Mr. Hosmer Angel.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031.S10> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/III> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "31"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C1" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/mary> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P031> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P032.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "10894"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P032.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P032> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P032.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "10768"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P032.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“I suppose,” said Holmes, “that when Mr. Windibank came back from France he was very annoyed at your having gone to the ball.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P032.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P032> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/III> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
