<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P039> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/mary> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P039> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P040.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "12167"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P040.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P040> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P040.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "12118"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P040.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Were you engaged to the gentleman at this time?”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P040.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P040> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/III> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P040> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "40"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P040> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P040> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C1" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P040> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/holmes> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P040> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "12190"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "12169"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Oh, yes, Mr. Holmes." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "12241"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "12191"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "We were engaged after the first walk that we took." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "12252"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "12242"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Hosmer—Mr." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "12312"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "12253"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P041.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Angel—was a cashier in an office in Leadenhall Street—and—”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
