<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P053> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P053> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C1" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P053> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/mary> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P053> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P054.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "14833"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P054.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P054> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P054.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "14811"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P054.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“It missed him, then?”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P054.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P054> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/III> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
