<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P054> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P054> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C1" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P054> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/holmes> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P054> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P055.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "14900"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P055.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P055> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P055.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "14835"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P055.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Yes, sir; for he had started to England just before it arrived.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P055.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P055> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/III> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P055> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "55"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P055> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P055> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C1" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P055> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/mary> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P055> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "14928"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "14902"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Ha! that was unfortunate." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "14977"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "14929"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Your wedding was arranged, then, for the Friday." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "15002"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "14978"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Was it to be in church?”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/III> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "56"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C1" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/holmes> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P056> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "15032"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "15004"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Yes, sir, but very quietly." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "15149"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "15033"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "It was to be at St. Saviour’s, near King’s Cross, and we were to have breakfast afterwards at the St. Pancras Hotel." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "15328"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "15150"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Hosmer came for us in a hansom, but as there were two of us he put us both into it and stepped himself into a four-wheeler, which happened to be the only other cab in the street." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "15517"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "15329"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "We got to the church first, and when the four-wheeler drove up we waited for him to step out, but he never did, and when the cabman got down from the box and looked there was no one there!" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "15629"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "15518"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "The cabman said that he could not imagine what had become of him, for he had seen him get in with his own eyes." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S05> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "15759"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "15630"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "That was last Friday, Mr. Holmes, and I have never seen or heard anything since then to throw any light upon what became of him.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057.S06> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/III> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "57"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C1" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/mary> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P057> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P058.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "15834"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P058.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P058> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P058.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "15761"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P058.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“It seems to me that you have been very shamefully treated,” said Holmes." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P058.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
