<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "15836"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Oh, no, sir!" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "15890"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "15850"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "He was too good and kind to leave me so." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "16147"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "15891"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Why, all the morning he was saying to me that, whatever happened, I was to be true; and that even if something quite unforeseen occurred to separate us, I was always to remember that I was pledged to him, and that he would claim his pledge sooner or later." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "16245"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "16148"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "It seemed strange talk for a wedding-morning, but what has happened since gives a meaning to it.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P059.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
