<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P061.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "I believe that he foresaw some danger, or else he would not have talked so." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P061.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
