<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "16729"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Yes; and he seemed to think, with me, that something had happened, and that I should hear of Hosmer again." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
