<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "16837"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "As he said, what interest could anyone have in bringing me to the doors of the church, and then leaving me?" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "17151"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "16945"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Now, if he had borrowed my money, or if he had married me and got my money settled on him, there might be some reason, but Hosmer was very independent about money and never would look at a shilling of mine." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "17186"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "17152"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "And yet, what could have happened?" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "17214"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
