<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "And why could he not write?" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S05> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "17292"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "17215"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Oh, it drives me half-mad to think of it, and I can’t sleep a wink at night.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P067.S06> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
