<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P068.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "17377"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P068.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“I shall glance into the case for you,” said Holmes, rising, “and I have no doubt that we shall reach some definite result." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P068.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P068.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "17595"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P068.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P068> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P068.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "17501"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P068.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Let the weight of the matter rest upon me now, and do not let your mind dwell upon it further." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P068.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P068.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "17691"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P068.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P068> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P068.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "17596"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P068.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Above all, try to let Mr. Hosmer Angel vanish from your memory, as he has done from your life.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
