<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P078.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P078> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P078.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "18341"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P078.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "You will leave the papers here, and remember the advice which I have given you." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P078.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
