<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P078.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "18421"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P078.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Let the whole incident be a sealed book, and do not allow it to affect your life.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P078.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
