<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P079.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "18559"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P079.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "I shall be true to Hosmer." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P079.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P079.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "18629"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P079.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P079> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P079.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "18586"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P079.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "He shall find me ready when he comes back.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
