<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P080.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "18771"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P080.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P080> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P080.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "18631"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P080.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "For all the preposterous hat and the vacuous face, there was something noble in the simple faith of our visitor which compelled our respect." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P080.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P080.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "18902"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P080.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P080> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P080.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "18772"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P080.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "She laid her little bundle of papers upon the table and went her way, with a promise to come again whenever she might be summoned." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P080.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
