<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P081.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "19077"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P081.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P081> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P081.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "18904"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P081.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Sherlock Holmes sat silent for a few minutes with his fingertips still pressed together, his legs stretched out in front of him, and his gaze directed upward to the ceiling." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P081.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P081.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "19320"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P081.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P081> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P081.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "19078"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P081.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Then he took down from the rack the old and oily clay pipe, which was to him as a counsellor, and, having lit it, he leaned back in his chair, with the thick blue cloud-wreaths spinning up from him, and a look of infinite languor in his face." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P081.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P081> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/IV> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P081> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "81"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P081> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
