<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "19377"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "19322"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Quite an interesting study, that maiden,” he observed." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "19474"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "19378"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“I found her more interesting than her little problem, which, by the way, is rather a trite one." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "19608"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "19475"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "You will find parallel cases, if you consult my index, in Andover in ’77, and there was something of the sort at The Hague last year." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "19689"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "19609"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Old as is the idea, however, there were one or two details which were new to me." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "19735"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "19690"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "But the maiden herself was most instructive.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082.S05> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/IV> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
