<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/holmes> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P082> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P083.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "19825"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P083.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P083> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P083.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "19737"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P083.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“You appeared to read a good deal upon her which was quite invisible to me,” I remarked." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P083.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P083> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/IV> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P083> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "83"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P083> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P083> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C2" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P083> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/watson> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P083> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "19864"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "19827"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Not invisible but unnoticed, Watson." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "19938"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "19865"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "You did not know where to look, and so you missed all that was important." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "20085"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "19939"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "I can never bring you to realise the importance of sleeves, the suggestiveness of thumb-nails, or the great issues that may hang from a boot-lace." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "20140"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "20086"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Now, what did you gather from that woman’s appearance?" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "20154"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "20141"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Describe it.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084.S05> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/IV> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "84"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C2" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/holmes> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P084> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "20247"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "20156"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Well, she had a slate-coloured, broad-brimmed straw hat, with a feather of a brickish red." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "20344"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "20248"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Her jacket was black, with black beads sewn upon it, and a fringe of little black jet ornaments." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "20451"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "20345"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Her dress was brown, rather darker than coffee colour, with a little purple plush at the neck and sleeves." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "20522"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "20452"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Her gloves were greyish and were worn through at the right forefinger." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "20550"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "20523"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Her boots I didn’t observe." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S05> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "20682"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "20551"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P085.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "She had small round, hanging gold earrings, and a general air of being fairly well-to-do in a vulgar, comfortable, easy-going way.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
