<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "20749"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“’Pon my word, Watson, you are coming along wonderfully." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "20844"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "20806"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "You have really done very well indeed." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "20973"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "20845"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "It is true that you have missed everything of importance, but you have hit upon the method, and you have a quick eye for colour." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
