<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "20974"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Never trust to general impressions, my boy, but concentrate yourself upon details." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "21103"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "21057"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "My first glance is always at a woman’s sleeve." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S05> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "21172"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "21104"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "In a man it is perhaps better first to take the knee of the trouser." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S06> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
