<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S08> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "21280"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S08> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "The double line a little above the wrist, where the typewritist presses against the table, was beautifully defined." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S08> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
