<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S09> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "The sewing-machine, of the hand type, leaves a similar mark, but only on the left arm, and on the side of it farthest from the thumb, instead of being right across the broadest part, as this was." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S09> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
