<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P087.S10> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "I then glanced at her face, and, observing the dint of a pince-nez at either side of her nose, I ventured a remark upon short sight and typewriting, which seemed to surprise her.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
