<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P089.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "I was then much surprised and interested on glancing down to observe that, though the boots which she was wearing were not unlike each other, they were really odd ones; the one having a slightly decorated toe-cap, and the other a plain one." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
