<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P090.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "22370"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P090.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "I asked, keenly interested, as I always was, by my friend’s incisive reasoning." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P090.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
