<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P094.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P094> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P094.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "23710"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P094.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Absolutely no clue in them to Mr. Angel, save that he quotes Balzac once." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P094.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
