<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P094.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P094> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P094.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "23784"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P094.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "There is one remarkable point, however, which will no doubt strike you.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P094.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
