<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P099.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“I cannot say that I do unless it were that he wished to be able to deny his signature if an action for breach of promise were instituted.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P099.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
