<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "24451"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "However, I shall write two letters, which should settle the matter." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "24682"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "24519"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "One is to a firm in the City, the other is to the young lady’s stepfather, Mr. Windibank, asking him whether he could meet us here at six o’clock tomorrow evening." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "24753"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "24683"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "It is just as well that we should do business with the male relatives." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "24895"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "24754"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "And now, Doctor, we can do nothing until the answers to those letters come, so we may put our little problem upon the shelf for the interim.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P100.S05> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
