<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P103> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P104.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "26459"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P104.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P104> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P104.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "26432"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P104.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Well, have you solved it?”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
