<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P110.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“He has written to me to say that he would be here at six." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P110.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P110.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "27183"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P110.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P110> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P110.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "27174"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P110.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Come in!”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P110.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P110> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/V> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P110> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "110"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P110> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P110> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C3" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P110> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/holmes> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P110> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P111.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "27392"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P111.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P111> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P111.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "27185"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P111.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "The man who entered was a sturdy, middle-sized fellow, some thirty years of age, clean-shaven, and sallow-skinned, with a bland, insinuating manner, and a pair of wonderfully sharp and penetrating grey eyes." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P111.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P111.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "27539"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P111.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P111> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P111.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "27393"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P111.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "He shot a questioning glance at each of us, placed his shiny top-hat upon the sideboard, and with a slight bow sidled down into the nearest chair." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P111.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P111> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/V> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P111> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "111"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P111> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P111> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C3" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P111> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#narrator> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P111> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P112.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "27590"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P112.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P112> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P112.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "27541"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P112.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Good-evening, Mr. James Windibank,” said Holmes." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P112.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P112.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "27700"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P112.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P112> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P112.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "27591"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P112.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“I think that this typewritten letter is from you, in which you made an appointment with me for six o’clock?”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P112.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P112> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/V> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P112> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "112"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P112> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P112> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C3" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P112> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/holmes> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P112> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "27712"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "27702"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Yes, sir." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "27793"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "27713"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "I am afraid that I am a little late, but I am not quite my own master, you know." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "27938"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "27794"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "I am sorry that Miss Sutherland has troubled you about this little matter, for I think it is far better not to wash linen of the sort in public." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "28129"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "27939"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "It was quite against my wishes that she came, but she is a very excitable, impulsive girl, as you may have noticed, and she is not easily controlled when she has made up her mind on a point." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "28295"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "28130"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Of course, I did not mind you so much, as you are not connected with the official police, but it is not pleasant to have a family misfortune like this noised abroad." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S05> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "28381"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "28296"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Besides, it is a useless expense, for how could you possibly find this Hosmer Angel?”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113.S06> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/V> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "113"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C3" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/windibank> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P113> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P114.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "28508"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P114.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P114> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P114.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "28383"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P114.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“On the contrary,” said Holmes quietly; “I have every reason to believe that I will succeed in discovering Mr. Hosmer Angel.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P114.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P114> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/V> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P114> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "114"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P114> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P114> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C3" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P114> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/holmes> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P114> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P115.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "28568"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P115.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P115> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P115.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "28510"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P115.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Mr. Windibank gave a violent start and dropped his gloves." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P115.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P115.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "28606"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P115.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P115> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P115.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "28569"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P115.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“I am delighted to hear it,” he said." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P115.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
