<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P116> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/holmes> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P116> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P117.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "29281"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P117.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P117> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P117.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "29107"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P117.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“We do all our correspondence with this machine at the office, and no doubt it is a little worn,” our visitor answered, glancing keenly at Holmes with his bright little eyes." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P117.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P117> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/V> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P117> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#order> "117"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P117> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P117> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C3" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P117> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/windibank> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P117> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "29382"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "29283"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“And now I will show you what is really a very interesting study, Mr. Windibank,” Holmes continued." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "29491"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "29383"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“I think of writing another little monograph some of these days on the typewriter and its relation to crime." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "29554"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "29492"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "It is a subject to which I have devoted some little attention." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "29623"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "29555"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "I have here four letters which purport to come from the missing man." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "29649"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "29624"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "They are all typewritten." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S05> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "29863"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "29650"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "In each case, not only are the ‘e’s’ slurred and the ‘r’s’ tailless, but you will observe, if you care to use my magnifying lens, that the fourteen other characteristics to which I have alluded are there as well.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118.S06> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inSection> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/section/V> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
