<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/story/holmes> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P118> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P119.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "29925"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P119.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P119> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P119.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "29865"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P119.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Mr. Windibank sprang out of his chair and picked up his hat." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P119.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P119.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "30002"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P119.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P119> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P119.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "29926"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P119.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“I cannot waste time over this sort of fantastic talk, Mr. Holmes,” he said." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P119.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P119.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "30080"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P119.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P119> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
