<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P122.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“There is no possible getting out of it, Mr. Windibank." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P122.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
