<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P122.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "It is quite too transparent, and it was a very bad compliment when you said that it was impossible for me to solve so simple a question." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P122.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
