<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P124.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P124> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P124.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "30749"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P124.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“I am very much afraid that it is not." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P124.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P124.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "30910"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P124.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P124> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P124.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "30788"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P124.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "But between ourselves, Windibank, it was as cruel and selfish and heartless a trick in a petty way as ever came before me." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P124.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P124.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "31001"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P124.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P124> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P124.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "30911"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P124.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Now, let me just run over the course of events, and you will contradict me if I go wrong.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P124.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
