<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "32821"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“Very likely not." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "33043"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "32839"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "However that may be, the young lady was very decidedly carried away, and, having quite made up her mind that her stepfather was in France, the suspicion of treachery never for an instant entered her mind." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "33171"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "33044"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "She was flattered by the gentleman’s attentions, and the effect was increased by the loudly expressed admiration of her mother." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "33313"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "33172"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S04> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Then Mr. Angel began to call, for it was obvious that the matter should be pushed as far as it would go if a real effect were to be produced." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S04> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "33436"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "33314"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S05> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "There were meetings, and an engagement, which would finally secure the girl’s affections from turning towards anyone else." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S05> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "33484"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "33437"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S06> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "But the deception could not be kept up forever." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S06> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S07> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "33541"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S07> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S07> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "33485"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S07> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "These pretended journeys to France were rather cumbrous." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S07> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S08> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "33771"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S08> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S08> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "33542"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S08> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "The thing to do was clearly to bring the business to an end in such a dramatic manner that it would leave a permanent impression upon the young lady’s mind and prevent her from looking upon any other suitor for some time to come." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S08> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S09> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "33931"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S09> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S09> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "33772"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S09> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Hence those vows of fidelity exacted upon a Testament, and hence also the allusions to a possibility of something happening on the very morning of the wedding." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S09> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S10> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "34113"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S10> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S10> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "33932"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S10> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "James Windibank wished Miss Sutherland to be so bound to Hosmer Angel, and so uncertain as to his fate, that for ten years to come, at any rate, she would not listen to another man." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S10> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S11> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "34306"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S11> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S11> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "34114"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S11> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "As far as the church door he brought her, and then, as he could go no farther, he conveniently vanished away by the old trick of stepping in at one door of a four-wheeler and out at the other." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S11> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S12> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "34360"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S12> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S12> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "34307"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S12> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "I think that was the chain of events, Mr. Windibank!”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P128.S12> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
