<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P129.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P129> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P129.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "34362"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P129.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "Our visitor had recovered something of his assurance while Holmes had been talking, and he rose from his chair now with a cold sneer upon his pale face." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P129.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
