<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P129> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#printedPage> "8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P129> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#revealedBy> "C4" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P129> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#speaker> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#narrator> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P129> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Paragraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P130.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "34691"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P130.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P130> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P130.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "34516"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P130.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“It may be so, or it may not, Mr. Holmes,” said he, “but if you are so very sharp you ought to be sharp enough to know that it is you who are breaking the law now, and not me." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P130.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P130.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "34851"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P130.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P130> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P130.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "34692"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P130.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "I have done nothing actionable from the first, but as long as you keep that door locked you lay yourself open to an action for assault and illegal constraint.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P130.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
