<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P132.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P132> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P132.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "35548"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P132.S01> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“There’s a cold-blooded scoundrel!” said Holmes, laughing, as he threw himself down into his chair once more." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P132.S01> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P132.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "35757"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P132.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P132> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P132.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "35658"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P132.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "“That fellow will rise from crime to crime until he does something very bad, and ends on a gallows." <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P132.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P132.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#endOffset> "35828"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P132.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#inParagraph> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P132> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P132.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#startOffset> "35758"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P132.S03> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "The case has, in some respects, been not entirely devoid of interest.”" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P132.S03> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
