<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P138.S02> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#text> "You may remember the old Persian saying, ‘There is danger for him who taketh the tiger cub, and danger also for whoso snatches a delusion from a woman.’" <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
<http://example.org/dectective/edition/text/P138.S02> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/dectective/edition#Sentence> <http://example.org/dectective/edition/text> .
