<http://example.org/dectective/profile#CommunicativeAct> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An act of telling or writing addressed to someone. Unlike crminf:I1 Argumentation (and E13, a subclass of I1 in CRMinf 1.2.1) it does NOT presuppose sincerity: the speaker's belief in the content is represented separately, if at all." <http://example.org/dectective/asserted/shared> .
