<http://example.org/dectective/profile#hasDefectProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Set of typing defects of a machine. Making it owl:InverseFunctionalProperty encodes Holmes's individuality principle (P116.S01-S02); that axiom is NOT shared: it lives only in the worlds that adopt it." <http://example.org/dectective/asserted/shared> .
